WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.304
The family was in the kitchen.

2
00:00:06.305 --> 00:00:10.026
Mom was cooking dinner.

3
00:00:10.027 --> 00:00:13.728
"How was school today?" Dad asked.

4
00:00:13.729 --> 00:00:18.218
"We had a fire drill," said Emmy.

5
00:00:18.219 --> 00:00:22.218
"Everybody had to walk outside," said Harry.

6
00:00:22.219 --> 00:00:25.414
"Hmm," said Dad.

7
00:00:25.415 --> 00:00:29.601
"We should have a family fire drill."

8
00:00:29.602 --> 00:00:32.335
"Yes!" said Mom.

9
00:00:32.336 --> 00:00:37.583
"Let's have a fire drill before dinner."

10
00:00:37.584 --> 00:00:41.444
"What should we do?" Emmy asked.

11
00:00:41.445 --> 00:00:46.522
Dad pointed to the smoke alarm.

12
00:00:46.523 --> 00:00:50.545
"I'll make the smoke alarm go off," he said.

13
00:00:50.546 --> 00:00:54.978
"Then we'll walk outside to a safe place."

14
00:00:54.979 --> 00:01:00.126
"Let's go to the tree house!" Oliver said.

15
00:01:00.127 --> 00:01:03.307
"Good idea!" Dad said.

16
00:01:03.308 --> 00:01:07.618
"Get ready, everybody!"

17
00:01:07.619 --> 00:01:12.410
"I'll tell Aunt Judy to get ready," Emmy said.

18
00:01:12.411 --> 00:01:17.885
Emmy ran to Aunt Judy's room.

19
00:01:17.886 --> 00:01:22.669
Oliver and Harry ran to Harry's room.

20
00:01:22.670 --> 00:01:25.594
Everybody waited.

21
00:01:25.595 --> 00:01:29.553
Whoop! Whoop! went the smoke alarm.

22
00:01:29.554 --> 00:01:34.623
Everybody walked quickly to the tree house.

23
00:01:34.624 --> 00:01:38.626
Dad counted the family.

24
00:01:38.627 --> 00:01:41.547
"Six people!"

25
00:01:41.548 --> 00:01:45.213
"Our family is safe," Mom said.

26
00:01:45.214 --> 00:01:49.800
"Good job, everyone!"

27
00:01:49.801 --> 00:01:52.878
The family walked back to the house.

28
00:01:52.879 --> 00:01:59.110
Dad opened the back door.

29
00:01:59.111 --> 00:02:02.945
Harry sniffed.

30
00:02:02.946 --> 00:02:08.008
Emmy sniffed.

31
00:02:08.009 --> 00:02:11.569
"Something smells bad," said Harry.

32
00:02:11.570 --> 00:02:16.953
"Yes!" said Emmy. "I smell smoke!"

33
00:02:16.954 --> 00:02:19.733
"Oh no!" Mom cried.

34
00:02:19.734 --> 00:02:27.104
She ran to the stove.

35
00:02:27.105 --> 00:02:35.722
"I burned our dinner!"

